<codeline lineno="126"><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(tmax0<sp/>==<sp/>tmax)<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">then</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">!This<sp/>happens<sp/>ONLY<sp/>on<sp/>ONE<sp/>processor<sp/>because<sp/>of<sp/>fudge<sp/>factor<sp/>above.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="127"><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>xgmax=geo_x(itmax,jtmax)</highlight></codeline>
